> solve y'' + y = 0 with y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0 using laplace
  ucas: laplace solve y'' + y = 0 with y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0
y'' + y = 0, y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0
  transformed: (s^2 + 1)Y(s) - (s) = 0
  Y(s) = s/(s^2 + 1)
  y(t) = cos(t)    for t >= 0
  poles of Y: +-i
  check: residual of the equation at 201 points of [0, 10]: max 0; initial values hold (max difference 0)
  check: a numeric solution (RK4, h = 1/1000) agrees at 20 points of [0, 10]: max difference 6.6e-14
> the generating function of fibonacci
  ucas: genfunc fibonacci
fibonacci: a[n+2] = a[n+1] + a[n], a[0] = 0, a[1] = 1
  a[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = x/(1 - x - x^2)    for |x| < (-1 + sqrt(5))/2
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = (-1 + sqrt(5))/4 is 0.518927630227216, G = 0.518927630227215 (difference 1.1e-16)
> the exponential generating function of 2^n
  ucas: egf 2^n
  E(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n/n! = e^(2x)
  check: the series at x = 1/4 and 1/2 matches E (max relative difference 2.7e-16)
> the generating function of catalan numbers
  ucas: genfunc catalan numbers
catalan numbers: binom(2n, n)/(n + 1)
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = (1 - sqrt(1 - 4x))/(2x)    for |x| < 1/4
  from the library: (1 - sqrt(1 - 4u))/(2u)
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = 1/8 is 1.17157287525381, G = 1.17157287525381 (difference 2.2e-16)
> solve y[n+1] = 2y[n], y[0] = 1 using the z transform
  ucas: zsolve y[n+1] = 2y[n], y[0] = 1
y[n+1] = 2y[n], y[0] = 1
  transformed: (z - 2)Y(z) - (z) = 0
  Y(z) = z/(z - 2)
  y[n] = 2^n    for n >= 0
  poles of Y: 2
  check: iterating the recurrence gives the same y[0..39] (max relative difference 0)
> the generating function of the squares
  ucas: genfunc squares
squares: n^2
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = (x + x^2)/(1 - 3x + 3x^2 - x^3)    for |x| < 1
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = 1/2 is 6, G = 6 (difference 8.9e-16)
> the exponential generating function of fibonacci
  ucas: egf fibonacci
fibonacci: a[n+2] = a[n+1] + a[n], a[0] = 0, a[1] = 1
  a[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5
  E(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n/n! = sqrt(5)*e^((1 + sqrt(5))/2*x)/5 - sqrt(5)*e^(-(-1 + sqrt(5))/2*x)/5
  check: the series at x = 1/4 and 1/2 matches E (max relative difference 5.6e-17)
